{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 614,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f349e00df62413b1cc92b5f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟超嗨的朋友们一起玩\\n实在是非常轻松愉快……\\n虽然会不停回荡歌曲的节奏所以很累。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a400996145afeb3f4ded3ab81e9425c77dc07922933dccf9f803609a6df58113",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "245"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d532f2674d540ba1b3f2862",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就算鲁莽也无所谓……\\n正因为如此……！\\n情况才会──有趣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91dea04c6a4b99f8096d1b161f4fb5d928bef31c717ec07f0ae2d12f32065e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240544f580b404f2edefffe4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "化遗憾为力量，将悲叹\\n寄托于下次──即使是执念，\\n也可以是多种面貌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "60fcb5bd49d7bd712245717a967b40ad67fce2ce9b29760d5ed8bbf342be508f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "247"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af9e96b220c204c1ebda0eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好きな曲、教えてくれますか？\\n弾けるようになっておくので…\\nいつか聞いてもらえたらなって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014579c49884ce78aa218d9ae65ed3db5d9c4c655d233e854d55f677d4cad324",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "248"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8450d35ae54b51defd03217c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……………………。\\n集中なさったら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7dac12d1e84378ec7c91d3a16969a4e6523d56c4d4f80ded193ce27b3007b9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "249"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41e31353b9f0b25fe276ab3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然输赢确实也很重要……\\n但能够跟一起奔跑的劲敌\\n并肩共舞……这种感觉也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8cbff73f6b21e83bd3492ba8a805679c996e7dcccc148bf2608df4b52a5b746",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b9b3300a0dc3193674a314c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "リズムを刻みたくなるmusicだ…\\n身を委ねて、踊り明かそうぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d47de3ec5617489b4f3b8214dc4ffb63e110ed535c3329d79ab5656e3e15cd6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "250"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070d35e14be0e4a38f2e4d0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "パフォーマンスを上げるのに、\\n音楽は必須よね♪\\nさあ、盛り上がっていきましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e34c08c70864ca3a4e3727402d09f103532af1c50d9e57cb4946f80db11aa4cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0dbf865c9f7d01c378e4d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "凪いだ夜の海みたいな…\\nそんな静かな曲、あるかな…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f75da99f2c2381ef33a095bd3daddb0b0b290adf848628af3d9a4a613563efde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c48f3a6cda06bafc7df29c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使沮丧，离憧憬目标还很遥远……\\n我也不会停下脚步。\\n如同这首歌般继续前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57151f4e9e2bbc8eea48ec7f08487604aecfc90035faf12c08fbb3320e6e580e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "253"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4313b041d039d8bcdd5655d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是一首勇往直前，非常棒的歌呢。\\n绝不退让的意志和希望达成的梦想\\n……背负这一切奔跑的我也是如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d93e7d98ba98cd56aa6ff2d8c28895a2ebb8a90141b45c2a15a152bde1e7902",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c34c43d03444d50696305205",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "そうよね――『何回だって\\n何度だって』。逆境をひっくり返し\\n栄冠を手にしてみせるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b49b1e2dddfc83323d796b174c5abdd35f38760948ab25dbffc6ca2fe694e67f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a28a3a11a8546868dc6f5a36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "僕だって、負けたくない…。\\n僕だって、前に進みたい…。\\nそんな時…勇気をくれる歌です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71722f4d990054de84bc1254f642874adf5d3ed5acd0a33b5482c9531ed348e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "256"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84c3ca24b2e3852a9163739",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不屈の闘争、不滅の闘志――\\n私も、“最強”を目指し\\n進み続けるだけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ac5246734b1325949f2cb56ba1ab87814ad1f73e5b0f4211799786b37d1f1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "257"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43aaef4fa0df1326b7dbeb12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、なんと鮮烈なパッショーネ！\\n騎士たちの奏でるメロディーアに、\\n魂までも焦がされそうだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "978ab11614265ed348abb46f073b22bd0364aa9cb32ff18af5e91872830b9079",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "258"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998b3acc6c10ece76905dac7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想起了追逐憧憬的背影……\\n来到这座学园那一天的心情！\\n这次轮到我发光发热了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4de347359ff7c4d73ad82e4118f71fdbd74b91e62bca1f1e6b11cf99cff82eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "259"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f07ea9d77b318cf0ef8dda9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我说啊，这只是歌词而已！\\n根本完全！一丁点！\\n都不可能是我的心声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28baf60661901b6026fd818500c23e012e5712ceee61ed2be5856b1d5d54683d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:699f83bc3ad2fd6ac320d19d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是充满活力的加油曲呢！\\n会激起想要不断挑战新事物的念头，\\n整个人提起了干劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f802a79ea8fa2681536bdbb7fd7bdcc27d9a3bd625a4bb36344c601ef7352b9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5629e78e337e9ecbd158640",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论到何处一直跑下去吧……\\n我希望能用珍惜的心情，\\n将这个消息唱出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a1905e9ee334b5374b90a065462dec9e65656f210197aa7304406dfeaafce1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:782b656e0084e44259481d58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "憧憬着会长，被小北憧憬！\\n嘻嘻嘻！我看起来\\n就像在闪亮亮的正中心对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcee2c44917a95d0c4893766651aad99d94e5a59fe4426ef37fec9d239b10d9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38a14407f88027ef1c19d9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "烦恼的时候也不展露在外\\n表现出轻松的样子才是帅气……\\n就是这个意思吧！我懂！",
      "source_fingerprint": "056ca9188302252dfac031ed5de331d14c2377d4c12b384330b5318a8f2249b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "263"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc8bbbe1b3146b2ce0fdebf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁都有绝不退让的愿望吧。\\n我的愿望就是成为第一！\\n我会拼命地去抓紧的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d5810e050d9f751e721439a6969903e2b2eada8079799b87ff0a10f8cc5b9d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "264"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23cf7872403306e78db03178",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "阿船可以前往任何地方……\\n来聊聊之前我和土星人\\n一起腌萝卜时的故事吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "242890c8eafd83685ad6ff9fe5fcdcb1169b4a5134b7b676e6e40ceb40e477fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "265"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d356bd7ccea785009faec89f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是一首为了让自己更加闪耀，\\n不断努力钻研的那些日子……\\n显得熠熠生辉的歌曲呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aae0fd6f56363c776988feff50c5acd5ee74c45ce3d8ca9777a670bac3dae09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "266"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7afc711dc74984096db5b9b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想听时尚又闪耀的\\n歌曲呢～！呐呐，\\n你有什么推荐的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19d7b3f4bacd3fac5d911eb87caeb4c55fd1a38aabef373b47592ce26f148270",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "267"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1456b558e3bb997641fcf6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇哦！这首歌！\\n很适合当英雄出场的BGM呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7abc13a081e6167bfe6a9864fd6fb6a46b684e058153975ddddd258f3c349778",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "268"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f877dfb331da2c7447f11e1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请慢慢欣赏音乐吧。\\n偶尔也需要给心灵放个假……\\n日程这边我会帮你调整好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f35a873be76d92d4392e18d105b38e0cf7cdbfd9f64f3dacd438edca19d3279a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "269"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d174f1b4421b2066e16df9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为都是很棒的歌曲，\\n先全都听过一轮也不错对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bc94a57f789de5bcf3a9ea85f6d411797c1779c185b53403d73b6584d4d9296",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df833c40dffbc4c7b6b28eea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果要说的话，我更喜欢\\n激烈的曲风。……你的喜好是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c682759c7ef877f423e22e9666aec0e220cf9471049c7ebeb94f0ff3902fd02b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "270"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5cf9d4ff3af3377c9fefe3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这不就是像「コロコロコロ介」一样的歌嘛！\\n幼儿园时期的小金船，\\n总有一天也会变得像岛洋葱一样优秀的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd7aef49a3c3808c24328d675ed2d1210b71fd51e952fcbf5a939e50226b71d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629a497cda298c1b2d2d2dee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想在最棒的舞台上站在C位，\\n把感激之情传达给大家——\\n在那一天到来之前，我绝不会放弃自己的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33905a7613bcc1a8f7b8d8fc48f973313f4f81b7e5d1b9f570f22bf94af1ae7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "272"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0bc20a16475b9a41a7cd7f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌也是那场耀眼\\n比赛的一部分——\\n这样想的话，就觉得非常珍爱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "006e70a2a84d9cbc47ffc6860d0abed0e95861754fd8d30c148c14915b1c5f6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "273"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807a6ee842e2a8d0fbb4958c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌的LIVE舞台真棒！\\n能感受到被伙伴们环绕的感觉，\\n真的就像置身于光之海洋一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "920b2228cabf1f57062fca3a3b1c69542a22fc9afb58fa1a6e23ed8b788f3b16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "274"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996fbbf7dafb5ec93ad97991",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我一定要拿下C位……\\n无论前方多么坎坷，\\n——I'm confident!",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcdbd889f65ecef256d24c53a863bc20a94dd2e31eaca1acd6a29f89f13a9e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "275"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7219669682b3111c5cb51130",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "360度被观众包围的\\n大舞台……我要成为\\n能自信跳舞的赛马娘——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0092c6f3a367e3b606dae78311d93baebbf4123d200d2b605498d80a264880",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "276"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31cf7d8fe640b458e71c5a15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌的舞蹈，姐姐会\\n教我诀窍呢～♪\\n成果……到LIVE上再让你见识♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee6b4edb61d15cbb046415fa70d2971bc8a0ad68b81f0fd8093ac5d1d6cab471",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "277"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86461230814dfc1d2f8de57b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中途那个“咻咻咻”的舞蹈也超棒！\\n我每天都在练习历代变身POSE\\n挑战，所以很拿手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ed615692b5e1fdaf2db6c272b05ade2b27833778eaabbc58177287a7068c54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "278"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:874125619137844834afc1e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "站在C位是基本——\\n要多完美、多英姿飒爽、\\n多热情地唱跳……唯有不断锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55f657c9badac59051c150a7cad1e6ba98ffd4e192c5f2a14e32a57a0894d2b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "279"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0045650913eec4f7987550b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我认为英里不长也不短。\\n胜负的关键只有一瞬间……\\n正是所谓的「光阴似箭」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec456cc1fad483e73009f8e0bc04481448caa83bce64a9da8c095c57b5d3f340",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc0249bd263e06ca0c7e8308",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Yell it louder now!\\n在房间里放这首歌，和太阳神\\n一起high到爆，超级开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a7f77f9a41f58322c708c06a2a6edec3293872e3cc12a9f71723962d83aba1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4829a52d2928e79a1436b0b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "阿尔丹经常会唱这首歌，\\n总是哼着——但不知为何，\\n只要我看着她就会停下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee173fec938e8e2d8c4f8ab4f1b1f8d2ad1b7603023e09ab77a316b39c830194",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "282"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290602d2e2b882fe30cb31d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对！！就是这样！！！\\n这份热情……完全就是运动！！\\n呜呜呜！！太棒的歌曲了……！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0893d64d98e983d253040ed9143207bbadb39d5f1b40a2a090b29c9d0dabe9da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "283"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f9d2facdf80b75badc3739f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次我哼这首歌，奖券和八重\\n都会加入……然后不知不觉就\\n变成了大合唱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f528603d2db96f04ecbc3f4103956ea928ee4a5c81ef55db0b92f3b69e97ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "284"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe813aaf61658938f0000ce5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『押忍！』——呵呵，这首歌\\n有很多让人能进入状态的合唱，\\n唱起来真的很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76d46ac196d7ddd2b7556b1eeb1564b5dedad42ef75429e4cd8ccd9430df885",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "285"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74cc676876e54ab7fc19ad61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与拥有友爱之人们的狂欢，\\n也是书写祝福日子的赞歌……\\n你也可以静下心来听一听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acdd406c8f360c56317f2581dc7211f1bdf93561709aa5451d1ce372836391fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "286"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:301dbbb0d877afffe1f2509e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "前几天——和谷水她们……\\n去唱了K歌——唱了这首。\\n是一首既Happy又很棒的歌——",
      "source_fingerprint": "832273ad76a4fa3c85a5212259ca3b680afa3e6ae6ee9c79ef7aa5255e136067",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "287"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bbe5907fce0eed88fc1b80e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在的年轻人超级喜欢的嗨歌哦♪\\n拿着羽毛扇跳舞绝对能\\n嗨到不行没跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0898eaa2303f3c6ea3d85d1426ec77bbb146b7c9533f0615e0fe236091aacc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "288"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22e2e9117a0642a215eadae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，混音一下也许会挺有趣的。\\n……让我跳？哈，开什么玩笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "753908323c1693d352f1694168db9dc9d8e6194a389588602b6edd625743aed8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:236b374df4e8c1234f3b486d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放学后与Friends一起听了歌！\\n结果被乌拉拉抓住，于是福来、\\n米浴和我也跟着跳起了舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce91782568eddfab3444010137593f03de8de6c389aaebba40bbcf82650c86b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6c3cc6f4ab63c8d3998693",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看到帝皇和强志在游戏厅\\n玩这首歌……下次我也\\n想去试试看了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e2d277e940797dc13bc4c84b9a53051199fa9d9ddf8252ef76e35ab14e15868",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27bc603e29f97a1cc1854635",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，之前会长用鼻音\\n哼唱的就是这首啊……\\n呵，这种曲子她也会听啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41de0e910a9b442415b6cee986ac5e280f1837f117e875b01b73b4249d4becb4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f404233743ed83ec6ecde919",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有点小伤感，但很好听的歌……\\n听着听着就觉得吃甜甜圈时\\n要一口一口细细品味才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a467a96e85e9e6c57d5b1687061e62684c4d8df44537619ba60a83c3170c1204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd8e2d5e43eb149e514d5f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要不要试着把这首歌录成\\n「试着唱了一下」的视频上传呢♪……\\n那一定会成为永恒的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fc740229ae066fbd798fbfd19c6e3a8c0aca45fac71ab967434d097306de3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "293"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4772b42188faf5063621cb39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "之前和小成路一起\\n找到一等星的时候！\\n我们一边唱这首歌一边回家的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "67004ed130b258c594c67b3f7770ace42d51976ddb1e36a8b17032632cfa9e71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "294"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e025b4b0b3bb6533dfec08c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要我不放弃，总有一天……也能成为星星……\\n不、不行！太自不量力了！\\n但……这首歌真的很能给人勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70cc6a8b41c14acac722a0ce4f2bf1dbab3fcbf77db5e95b08a1edcd2dcd237",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "295"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d018da4138387c07d6aad9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "难得有机会，\\n要不要用好音响来听听看？\\n我借你推荐的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae94b933b47dd867eabd7c2b214baaf49b87e92da4c1561a02552d8f9be37d2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4497743ab983439e0d5d8384",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼呼呼～♪\\n每首歌都很棒呢～。\\n真想在晒太阳的时候听呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "452ea70d4d29ee0e9bcc1d2ab4d0fbf4787e0db2892d4a46007aed5425371781",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a01b1d8733ba1a0a26b2898e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "“终点”是“银河的彼方”。\\n超越“第三宇宙速度”……\\n『一起守护』DPSE吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d33a23c72822230a0d2c0de4a1d4baa7ffb9a85f6ab5d484202c7047e887dfef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5379e31b18646f544a633d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "＜方舟＞，还有＜奇点崩坏＞……\\n真是太有趣了！深邃的可能性，\\n就让我们一起揭开谜底吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7878575d4e27fd8326071b0b8e9defb06947eb8f9620f0230dc3ea93463f3311",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f279e136d5e21b7be57c05a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇～这首歌曲也好棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcd841df4f4d50ca027b9f1f7c71e1aebaae8ea6bb556bd37973fc6c986d2e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e2a7d159405013ea9252ed6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身体会自然而然地跟着节奏摆动！\\nHey！训练员！\\nShall we dance？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8354ff73e6958893a517b5a1dbe3b279f82033e5fd72c14fdc78300876439ba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:874ee2156713c884f506f5d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宇宙旅行什么的也太豪华了吧！\\n说不定还能在银河正中央度假哟♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "06217c0775f8d76067478213b326dd1004fb0ed68a069500bc9eef65d30d927f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3a297024d15d91c7a7cc83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在几千万光年外闪耀……\\n那无人知晓的星辰光辉。\\n我要用自己的双眼——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a652fcb8ef8dea0b44cc9c7d04d2b31dda76ce0baf98f61c28540cf56fd34f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b36353c0112856056a9862",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每当听到这首歌就会有使命感。\\n安全锁已解除。任务\\n『拯救银河』……开始执行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "420b8644a2e9754ec5ca47caab1ec973fc669f9589f3b0f532c81fcffecdec54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f57379eeff3968d3b8f0f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，跳进音乐的泉水中！\\n摇滚、抒情、舞曲……\\n感受所有的声音吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14065ff5a1d1b4d7cc6a33e0dd792245b9a409feaccc7069591c328a4f3a03bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c1de934cdcf1d23d8113d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我家的蔬菜本身就很美味。\\n如果用心去烹饪，\\n那绝对是顶级的美食！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7281dcd23a61123ef9bcccb3b9adbadfd79090b98b61255886296ac5fea0a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ab3b446e056f22804f27fa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『不吃饭者无樱饼』！\\n好吃的饭和和果子都要多吃，\\n为身体和心灵补充营养！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee60adbbed538b5a9ea216d07ec9d4af85bf2afe6f089a0ed5729c9a2b496db5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eeaecb8a737d1793757b3c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做饭时最适合哼这首歌啦。\\n只要用心，无论歌曲还是饭菜\\n都会觉得『好吃』呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b113be359756210e2b856ea17f35ea575be17b186c5356bf04aecbee63eaa3c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22a3364b5786be6ca4e519b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听到大家笑着说我开动啦，\\n就会想再做一次……\\n美食真的能让大家幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b31e02760dc9b701396a365f65e5caffff9152bdc36c6776adadb2a7fb3d6e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b14c1c521715e916106408e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像花儿盛开般的歌，\\n又像风平浪静般温柔的旋律……\\n音乐也能激发设计灵感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f721b75d496cf21a1cc1fceaadd61de0e5541a260b9c0c859df8632a4523562",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:138584976e2500bf77dfb5e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，放大声点！\\n给我来点帅气的吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41549883aa0ac9398995b5c9487665f403ad060042c63c0f384182d89961713d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6fb743f7b84759fe51e3d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有少数人才能抵达的遥远顶点……\\n呵呵，的确是条\\n值得走完全程的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2d4a40b7a02af321d4db458d94a2da29b37649cb426bfda74855ef353e7180d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2696671f89514a493cd30421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "动人旋律，触及心灵的歌词……\\n音乐真是实用且\\n美妙的文化啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "445b9aa85ff496ae72ee28ea5d60a84aae91285bac1b0192ef5624f83a26517c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1ac773a99b2cb447ebbf1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，需要BGM吗。\\n那就让我来打个节拍吧。呀，那就，\\n直线走起♪呀，那就，最高速♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5422af12a6a1468389c77cee2e3bc46f1cb8241cd88056de0a9cc3514bcda41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a80b242034b46dfa9005ed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "东奔西走，跨越大海……\\n谁知道下次会在哪里唱歌呢。\\n可别错过哦，训练师酱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53996bc1fe5aa5029801b955505e725c6d1482b7838d969ff5df13b00e7c78ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44fb623d4190e7c21122a187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "未曾见过的世界……我所开辟的\\n道路尽头究竟有什么，我想走到尽头……\\n不，绝对要走到终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a75a1d48b8b16698adf8de27ed5d66bf47d004f7a7a80d0bea6cc9ad68b79a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d622b881c739a51e59b5bcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Con fuoco！热情如火！\\n与火焰的共舞，\\n没有比这更热烈的激情了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88515da7a9bafc972b92dd74ad0fcbbe3037514555c4f80c0222ed0fe2f3a69c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:412249fc03b653cc46810599",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着激烈舞蹈摇曳的战服——\\n一定是我最闪耀的舞台。\\n我要让它变成华丽的T台♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c6d250dc57cfd1065b16cff4d5cbd04addea74bb371e76f9c7d118512b51e83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c756366a6b34de05066506",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要用比那巨大音响还大的嗓门\\n大吼一声，\\n『最强的就是我』！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "065ca6c6d0d36f2f301d7e62b3cfc85b6cf2d5b1dc94bfa6aadd9a73e864d409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb013275eb6819753f86497",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标就是这首歌的C位……\\n无论旅途如何，\\n我都会到达终点的——",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec488fbe5d41cf4b81b1f242dea5f61c67306cb052e5b329a8b98128e809a70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "317"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
